  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Electricity meter of a dwelling unit, observing active power, active energy, voltage, current and frequency."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#DischargedEnergy",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "discharged energy"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid20"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Cumulative electrical energy a battery system has given back."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#DormRoom",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Sibling of pf:Apartment, not a subclass: it is the smallest separately monitored space, but it is neither self-contained nor separately billed, so pf:Apartment's definition does not hold of it."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "dorm room"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Space"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/bot#Space"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/bot#Zone"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Study-bedroom in a student residence, occupied under a tenancy but not self-contained — sanitary and cooking facilities are shared with the floor rather than contained within the room."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#ElectricCurrent",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "electric current"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid21"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Electric current flowing through the metering point."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#ElectricityAnalyzer",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "electricity analyzer"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Device"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/FeatureOfInterest"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Meter"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#ConsumptionMeter"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid22"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid23"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid24"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Electrical_Meter"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Panel-mounted meter observing the five quantities a consumption meter does and, in addition, the power quality of the supply — reactive and apparent power and the power factor between them."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#Floor",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Direct reuse — equivalent to bot:Storey, minted only to carry PosiFit annotations."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "floor"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/bot#Storey"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/bot#Zone"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Floor"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Horizontal level of a building, containing the apartments and common areas at that height."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#Frequency",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "frequency"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid25"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Frequency of the alternating supply at the metering point."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#GeneratedActiveEnergy",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Sibling of pf:ActiveEnergy for the same reason as pf:GeneratedActivePower."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "generated active energy"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid26"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Cumulative electrical energy delivered by an on-site generation system."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#GeneratedActivePower",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A sibling of pf:ActivePower, not a subclass: that class is defined as the power *drawn* by a monitored unit, and generation is the opposite sign of the same quantity."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "generated active power"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid27"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Instantaneous electrical power delivered by an on-site generation system."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#HeatingOnOffState",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "heating on/off state"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/State"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Whether the radiator a valve controls is currently calling for heat."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#HybridInverter",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Equipment, not a system: it is one box, and it is brick:isPartOf both the PV system and the battery system. Brick has no hybrid class, so brick:Photovoltaic_Inverter is the narrowest honest parent — narrowed further here by also serving storage."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "hybrid inverter"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Class"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Electrical_Equipment"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Entity"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Equipment"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Inverter"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Photovoltaic_Inverter"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/bot#Element"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Power conversion unit serving a PV array and a battery together, converting between the DC of both and the AC of the building supply."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#Illuminance",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "illuminance"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid28"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Luminous flux per unit area incident on a surface at a monitored site, the measure a weather station reports for ambient daylight."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#IndoorAirTemperature",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "indoor air temperature"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#Temperature"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Dry-bulb temperature of the air inside a monitored space."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#MeasurementPoint",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Narrower than brick:Point, not equivalent: sensing.axioms.ttl requires a measured quantity and a ref:TimeseriesReference, both optional in Brick. One point per quantity, so a pf:RoomComfortSensor has three."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "measurement point"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Class"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Entity"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Point"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid29"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid30"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Named stream of measurements a device produces for one observed quantity, carrying the external reference a client needs to fetch the values themselves — the graph holds the metadata, not the timeseries."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#OutdoorAirTemperature",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "outdoor air temperature"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#Temperature"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Dry-bulb temperature of the outdoor air at a monitored site."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#PVSystem",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The array, its mounting and its share of the conversion chain, taken as one system — panel-level detail is out of scope for the pilot."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "PV system"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Class"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Collection"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Electrical_System"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Energy_Generation_System"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Energy_System"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Entity"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#PV_Generation_System"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#System"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/FeatureOfInterest"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/bot#Element"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid34"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Photovoltaic generation installation on a building, converting incident solar radiation into electricity fed to the building or to storage."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#PowerFactor",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Dimensionless — its unit restriction is unit:UNITLESS."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "power factor"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid35"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Ratio of active to apparent power at the metering point, between zero and one."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#RatedEnergyCapacity",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Exists to give the pf:ratedEnergyCapacity number its unit: quantities carry units in this ontology, datatype properties do not."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "rated energy capacity"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid36"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Nameplate energy a storage system holds when full, as declared by its manufacturer — a fixed rating, not an observation."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#ReactivePower",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "reactive power"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid37"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Power oscillating between source and reactive load at the metering point, doing no net work."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#RelativeHumidity",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "relative humidity"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid38"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Ratio of the water vapour present in the air to the amount that would saturate it at the same temperature."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#RoomComfortSensor",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "One device, three observed properties — no Brick match, since Brick models each measurement as its own single-quantity sensor point."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "room comfort sensor"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Device"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/FeatureOfInterest"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Sensor"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#Sensor"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid39"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid40"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid41"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Multi-sensor device mounted in a dwelling space, observing indoor air temperature, relative humidity and CO2 concentration."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#Sensor",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "sensor"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Device"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/FeatureOfInterest"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Sensor"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid42"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Sensor"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Device measuring a physical property of a building space and reporting it to the PosiFit ingestion pipeline."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#Site",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Narrower than bot:Site, not equivalent: spatial.axioms.ttl requires a wgs84 zero point, which BOT leaves optional."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "site"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/bot#Site"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/bot#Zone"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid43"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Site"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Pilot location PosiFit monitors, containing one or more buildings and georeferenced by a zero point."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#SmartRadiatorValve",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Dual role: primarily an actuator (saref:controls the setpoint and its own position), but it senses too, so sensing.axioms.ttl also makes it a pf:Sensor — an edge the registry cannot carry, since align targets may only point at vendored prefixes. saref:Sensor and saref:FeatureOfInterest are repeated here because that pf:Sensor edge is invisible without a reasoner."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "smart thermostatic radiator valve"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Actuator"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Device"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/FeatureOfInterest"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Sensor"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#Sensor"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid44"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid45"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid46"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid47"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid48"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid49"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid50"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid51"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Valve"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Thermostatic radiator valve with a motorised actuator and an onboard radio, throttling the flow through one radiator against a temperature setpoint while reporting the conditions it senses in the room."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#StateOfCharge",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Distinct from pf:BatteryLevel, which is the remaining charge of a device's own cell — a housekeeping signal, not a storage asset's operating state."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "state of charge"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid52"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Energy currently stored in a battery system as a fraction of the energy it holds when full."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#Temperature",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "temperature"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid53"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Dry-bulb temperature of monitored air, indoors or outdoors."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#TemperatureSetpoint",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Under pf:Temperature so it inherits the degree Celsius restriction; it is a temperature, distinguished by being controlled rather than observed."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "temperature setpoint"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#Temperature"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Target air temperature a controlling device is working towards — the commanded value, not an observation of the room."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#ValvePosition",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "valve position"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid54"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Degree to which a valve stands open, from fully closed to fully open."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#Voltage",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "voltage"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid55"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Electric potential difference at the metering point."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#WeatherStation",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Not a pf:Sensor: it is a multi-quantity outdoor station rather than a device observing one property of one space, and SAREF's own hierarchy has no station class between Device and Sensor."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "weather station"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Device"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/FeatureOfInterest"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid56"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid57"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid58"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid59"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Weather_Station"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Device mounted at a monitored site, observing the outdoor conditions the building is exposed to."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#WindSpeed",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "wind speed"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid60"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Speed of the air moving past a monitored site."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#Window",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "No external alignment: Brick has no plain Window class, only Automatic_Tint_Window, and IFC is not vendored."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "window"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/FeatureOfInterest"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Openable glazed opening in the envelope of a monitored space, the real world entity whose open/close state a window sensor observes."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#WindowOpenCloseState",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "saref:OpenCloseState was deprecated in SAREF V3.2.1, its history note directing such conditions to be modelled against saref:State instead."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "window open/close state"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/State"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Whether a window stands open or closed."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#WindowSensor",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "window sensor"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Device"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/FeatureOfInterest"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Sensor"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#Sensor"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid61"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid62"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Contact_Sensor"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Contact device mounted on a window, observing whether the window it is fitted to stands open or closed."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#installedIn",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/Device"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "installed in"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/bot#Zone"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Links a device to the zone it is physically mounted in."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#measures",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Narrower than saref:observes, which SAREF documents for devices, functions and commands — a point is none of those. The device keeps its own saref:observes triples; this says which of them a given stream is. No range: here — a point carries a saref:Property or a saref:State, and `range:` takes a single CURIE. The union sits in sensing.axioms.ttl, mirroring saref:observes, which SAREF leaves range-free for the same reason."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#MeasurementPoint"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "measures"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid1"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/observes"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Links a measurement point to the single quantity its stream carries."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#ratedEnergyCapacity",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The bare number. Its unit lives on pf:RatedEnergyCapacity, which sensing.axioms.ttl hangs off every battery system with saref:hasProperty."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/posifit/pf#BatteryStorageSystem"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "rated energy capacity"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Nameplate energy capacity of a storage system, in kilowatt-hours."
  } ]
} ]